<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id">ESR - Adele Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Esira</para>
  <para style="toc1">ESIRA GƖKPA</para>
  <para style="toc2">Esira</para>
  <para style="toc3">Esi</para>
  <para style="rem">Adele Ezra Edited and printed in December 2024 for community testing.</para>
  <para style="mt1">ESIRA</para>
  <para style="mt2">GƖKPA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZR 1" />
  <para style="s1">Sirusi ɛ kpà Yuda bete be biri bɛ san bɔɔlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 1:1" />Perisiya wogyu Kirusi wo bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan-gyangbasɛlɛ gaanɩ fɔ, Yahwe ɛ yɛ wade gɛtɛ ɛ dama wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Yeremiya wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ ɩ ba waanɩ. Yahwe ɛ kya Kirusi woturu gɛ ɛ yɛ bɛ san bɛ dɔ̀-dɔ̀ wo bugyu buu gedikʋn powu baanɩ gɛ bɛ ŋwara ade fɔ bɛ sɩ̀ alan,<verse eid="EZR 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 1:2" />ade gɛtɛ nmɩ Perisiya wogyu Sirusi ntɛ dɔ̀ fɔ n di alan,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 1:2">“Yahwe, Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa gatala fɔ ɛ ka gɛtʋnkwaa gii bugyu powu ɛ tɛ mɩ, gɛ e tiri mɩ ɛ sɩ̀ gɛtɛ nan sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ n tɛ wɔ Yerusalem, Yuda gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ. <verse eid="EZR 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 1:3" />Gɛ ɛyɩ powu gɛtɛ ì di wɔ bɛnɩ fɔ, Wurubwarɛ ɛ fɩya ma ɛyɩ, fɔ yaanɩ-kamasɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ talɩ bʋn san Yerusalem, Yuda gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma sere Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ, gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa Yerusalem fɔ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ.” <verse eid="EZR 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 1:4" />Gɛ ɔkʋn-kamasɛ gɛtɛ Isareli bete be kuruma bè si nkpa fɔ, baà bɛ tɛ̀ sɩka-fututu ma sɩka-sɩya, ma anyan-kpara, ma bɛnan, ma gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gɛtɛ gi ye ɛbɛ gbagba boo-ituru yaanɩ bɛ tɛ Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ Yerusalem.<verse eid="EZR 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 1:5" />Gɛ Yuda ma Benyamin baakpaara yɩɩ begyegeyelɛ ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma Lefi bete ma bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ kya bɛ ituru fɔ, bɛ pɩna koro gɛtɛ baà san Yerusalem bɛ ma sere Yahwe wo Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ.<verse eid="EZR 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 1:6" />Gɛ bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ powu gɛtɛ bè si gbɛma bɛ fɔ, bɛ kpà bɛ ma sɩka-fututu, ma sɩka-sɩya, ma anyan-kpara, ma bɛnan, fɩya, ma gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gɛtɛ gi ye boo-ituru yaanɩ. <verse eid="EZR 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 1:7" />Gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Sirusi, ɛ ka Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanyan gɛtɛ Nebukadinesa e tola ɛ ma sɩ̀ wo dikpen-kwo daanɩ fɔ, ɛ ba. <verse eid="EZR 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 1:8" />Peresiya wogyu Sirusi ɛ yɛ Miteredati gɛtɛ è di anyan-gbaagbaa yɩɩsɩlɛ fɔ ɛ ba, ɛ kalan yɩ gɛ ɛ ka yɩ ɛ sa Yuda wofoli wuugyegeyelɛ Sesibasa gʋlɔ. <verse eid="EZR 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 1:9" />Anyan gɛtɛ bɛ tɛ fɔ powu n di, sɩka-sɩya bɛtasa dikpilin ma fwo (30) tɛ gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀, ma sɩka-fututu bɛtasa nkpɩn ton (1,000) tɛ gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀, ma bɛtasa-kperen bɛkɩ dikpilin ma yɛkɩ (29), <verse eid="EZR 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 1:10" />ma sɩka-sɩya bɛtasa buruburu dikpilin ma fwo (30), ma sɩka-fututu bɛtasa nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ ma fwo (410), ma anyan-salɛ anyan-kurumakyɛɛ nkpɩn ton (1,000). <verse eid="EZR 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 1:11" />Sɩka-sɩya, ma sɩka-fututu yaanyan fɔ powu ɩ mɛ ɩgbaa ɩnyɔɔ ma nkpɩn kwarankɩ (5,400). Anyan nyayɩ gɛ Sesibasa ɛ ka, fɩya ma bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ ɔya gɛtɛ be ye Babilon bɛɛ fɔrɔ Yerusalem fɔ.<verse eid="EZR 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZR 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda bete gɛtɛ be ye gisela be biri bɛ san bɔɔlɛ fɔ baayere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 2:1" />Bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be biri bɛ ba bɔɔlɛ Yerusalem, ma Yuda gɛtɛ nafɔ Babilon wogyu Nebukedinesa e gye bɩtà ɛ da wɔlɛ fɔ baayere ntɛ ba lɛ (be biri bɛ ba Yerusalem ma Yuda, ɛkamasɛ ɛ san wo ditele daanɩ). <verse eid="EZR 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 2:2" />Boo begyegeyelɛ n di Serubabeli, ma Yesuwa, ma Nehemiya, ma Seraya, ma Reelayiya, ma Moridekayi, ma Bilisan, ma Misipa, ma Bigifayi, ma Rehum, ma Baana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 2:2">Isareli wakpaara ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be biri be ye Babilon bɛ ba fɔ baayere ma baasɔ ye dɩkpaara-kamasɛ daanɩ fɔ ntɛ ba lɛ.<verse eid="EZR 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 2:3" />Parosi wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, gbaa ma akpilin nɩyɛ ma fwo bɛnyɔɔ (2,172). <verse eid="EZR 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 2:4" />Sefatiya Ara wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, gɛkpɩn ma akpilin nɩyɛ ma fwo bɛnyɔɔ (372). <verse eid="EZR 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 2:5" />Ara wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin kwarankɩ ma fwo ton (775). <verse eid="EZR 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 2:6" />Pahati-Mowabi bebi-tenibi Yesuwa ma Yowabi boodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, gbaa ma nkpɩn bɩnaa ma fwo bɛnyɔɔ (2,812). <verse eid="EZR 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 2:7" />Elam wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, nkpɩn kooron akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo bɛnaa (1,254). <verse eid="EZR 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 2:8" />Satu wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, nkpɩn bɩnaa ma akpilin kwarankɩ ma ton (945). <verse eid="EZR 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 2:9" />Sakayi wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin nɩyɛ (760). <verse eid="EZR 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 2:10" />Bani wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma bɛnyɔɔ (642). <verse eid="EZR 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 2:11" />Bebayi wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, nkpɩn bisiyee ma dikpilin ma besiyee (623). <verse eid="EZR 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 2:12" />Asigadi wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, nkpɩn kooron ma dikpilin ma bɛnyɔɔ (1,222). <verse eid="EZR 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 2:13" />Adonikam wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin asiyee ma kooron (666). <verse eid="EZR 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 2:14" />Bigifayi wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, gbaa ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo kooron (2,056). <verse eid="EZR 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 2:15" />Adin wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo bɛnaa (454) <verse eid="EZR 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 2:16" />Ateri wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be ye Hesekiya wɔkwa waanɩ fɔ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba akpilin anaa ma fwo nɩyɛ (98). <verse eid="EZR 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 2:17" />Besayi wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, gɛkpɩn ma akpilin kooron ma besiyee (323). <verse eid="EZR 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 2:18" />Yora wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, akpilin ton ma fwo bɛnyɔɔ (112). <verse eid="EZR 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 2:19" />Hasum wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba gɛkpɩn ma dikpilin ma besiyee (223). <verse eid="EZR 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 2:20" />Gibari wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, akpilin anaa ma fwo ton (95). <verse eid="EZR 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 2:21" />Betelehem ditele dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba akpilin kooron ma besiyee (123). <verse eid="EZR 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 2:22" />Netofa ditele dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo kooron (56). <verse eid="EZR 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 2:23" />Anatoti ditele dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba Akpilin kooron ma nɩyɛ (128) <verse eid="EZR 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 2:24" />Asimafeti ditele dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, akpilin anyɔɔ ma bɛnyɔɔ (42). <verse eid="EZR 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 2:25" />Kiriyati-Yewarim, ma Kefira, ma Beeroti yaatele yɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin kwarankɩ ma besiyee (743). <verse eid="EZR 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 2:26" />Rama ma Geba baatele yɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, nkpɩn bisiyee ma dikpilin ma ɛkɩ (621). <verse eid="EZR 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 2:27" />Mikimasi ditele dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba akpilin kooron ma bɛnyɔɔ (122). <verse eid="EZR 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 2:28" />Betheli, ma Ayi baatele yɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, gɛkpɩn ma dikpilin ma besiyee (223). <verse eid="EZR 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 2:29" />Nebo ditele dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo bɛnyɔɔ (52). <verse eid="EZR 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 2:30" />Magibisi ditele dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, akpilin kwarankɩ ma fwo kooron (156). <verse eid="EZR 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 2:31" />Bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be ye Elam wofoli-nyɔɔfɛ waanɩ fɔ bɛ̀ ba, nkpɩn kooron ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo bɛnaa (1,254). <verse eid="EZR 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 2:32" />Harim ditele dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, gɛkpɩn ma akpilin kooron (320). <verse eid="EZR 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 2:33" />Lodi, ma Hadidi, ma Ono baatele yɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin kooron ma ton (725). <verse eid="EZR 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 2:34" />Yeriko ditele dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, gɛkpɩn ma akpilin kwarankɩ ma ton (345). <verse eid="EZR 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 2:35" />Senaa ditele dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, gbaa ma nkpɩn nɩyɛ ma dikpilin ma fwo (3,630).<verse eid="EZR 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 2:36" />Gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:36" />
  <para style="li" vid="EZR 2:36">Yedaya gɛtɛ e ye Yesuwa dɩkpaara fɔ, wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba nkpɩn bɩnaa ma akpilin nɩyɛ ma fwo besiyee (973). <verse eid="EZR 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 2:37" />Imire wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, nkpɩn ton ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo bɛnyɔɔ (1,052). <verse eid="EZR 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 2:38" />Pasihuri wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, nkpɩn kooron ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma kwarankɩ (1,247). <verse eid="EZR 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 2:39" />Harim wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, nkpɩn ton ma fwo kwarankɩ (1,017).<verse eid="EZR 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 2:40" />Lefi bete.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:40" />
  <para style="li" vid="EZR 2:40">Yesuwa ma Kadimiyeli gɛtɛ be ye Hodafiya wɔkwa waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, akpilin asiyee ma fwo bɛnaa (74).<verse eid="EZR 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 2:41" />Ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:41" />
  <para style="li" vid="EZR 2:41">Asafi wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, akpilin kooron ma nɩyɛ (128).<verse eid="EZR 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 2:42" />Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ diitunu wʋʋ bɛdɩyɛlɛ n di,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:42" />
  <para style="li" vid="EZR 2:42">Salum, ma Ateri, ma Talimon, ma Hatita, ma Sobayi boodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, akpilin kooron ma fwo yɛkɩ (139).<verse eid="EZR 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 2:43" />Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:43" />
  <para style="li" vid="EZR 2:43">Siha, ma Hasufa, ma Tabawoti,<verse eid="EZR 2:43" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 2:44" />ma Kerosi, ma Siyaha, ma Padon,<verse eid="EZR 2:44" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZR 2:45" />ma Lebana, ma Hagaba, ma Akubi,<verse eid="EZR 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZR 2:46" />ma Hagabi, ma Salimayi, ma Hanan,<verse eid="EZR 2:46" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZR 2:47" />ma Gideli, ma Gahari, ma Rewaya,<verse eid="EZR 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZR 2:48" />ma Resin, ma Nekoda, ma Gasam,<verse eid="EZR 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZR 2:49" />ma Usa, Paseya, ma Besayi,<verse eid="EZR 2:49" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZR 2:50" />ma Asinah, ma Mewunim, ma Nefusim,<verse eid="EZR 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZR 2:51" />ma Bakibuki, ma Hakufa, ma Haruri,<verse eid="EZR 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZR 2:52" />ma Basiluti, Mehida, ma Harisa,<verse eid="EZR 2:52" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZR 2:53" />ma Barikosi, ma Sisera, ma Tema,<verse eid="EZR 2:53" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZR 2:54" />ma Nesiya, ma Hatifa.<verse eid="EZR 2:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZR 2:55" />Solomon bɛsaranyan boodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ n di, Sotayi, ma Hassofereti, ma Peruda,<verse eid="EZR 2:55" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZR 2:56" />ma Yaala, ma Dakon, ma Giddeli,<verse eid="EZR 2:56" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZR 2:57" />ma Sefatiya, ma Hatili,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:57">ma Pokereti-Hasebayim, ma Ami.<verse eid="EZR 2:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZR 2:58" />Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ, boo-idu yɩɩ bɛnɩ ma Solomon bɛsaranyan bɛ̀ ba, gɛkpɩn ma akpilin yɛkɩ ma fwo bɛnyɔɔ (392).<verse eid="EZR 2:58" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZR 2:59" />Bɛnɩ gɛtɛ baayere ɩɩ ba lɛ, be ye gɛ Teli-Mela, ma Teli-Harisa, ma kerubi-Addon, ma Imma, atele yaanɩ, mɔ bɛn talɩ wùlà alɛ bɔɔ bɛnɩ boodu wu ye gɛ Isareli. <verse eid="EZR 2:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZR 2:60" />Delaya, ma Tobiya, ma Nekoda boodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ ba, nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo bɛnyɔɔ (652).<verse eid="EZR 2:60" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZR 2:61" />Gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ n di, Hobayiya, ma Hakosi, ma Barisilayi (ete gɛtɛ e to Gileyadi-te Barisilayi wobi-nanɩbi gɩna, gɛ bɛ yɛ bee kpèlè gɛlɛ fɔ.)<verse eid="EZR 2:61" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZR 2:62" />Be bugiti bootu ɛbɛ baayere, mɔ ben we yɩ. Gɛlɛ wuu koro be tiri bɛ be ye gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ baanɩ, yema bɛ ka bɛ anlɛ bɛnɩ ma dɩdɩɩ. <verse eid="EZR 2:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZR 2:63" />Gɛtʋnkwaa gɩɩnyalɛ fɔ ɛ sɩ̀ ose ɛ tɛ bɛ alɛ, bɛn na wura be di anyan-dɩlɛ-fɩrɩnfɩrɩn fɔ ka ma sere gɛtɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ɛkɩ ɛɛ̀ dama Urim ma Tumim boo koro e lila ade pɛ.<verse eid="EZR 2:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="EZR 2:64" />Bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ̀ ba Asepekyi anyɔɔ ma gbaa ɛkɩ ma gɛkpɩn ma akpilin nɩyɛ (42,360) <verse eid="EZR 2:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="EZR 2:65" />gɛtɛ bɛn kalan bɔɔ bɛsaranyan ma bɔɔ bɛsʋgʋgyan fɔ, bɛ̀ ba ɩgbaa isiyee ma nkpɩn kooron ma akpilin kooron ma fwo kwarankɩ (7,337), ma bɔɔ-ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ gɛkpɩn (200). <verse eid="EZR 2:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="EZR 2:66" />Bɛ̀ ba abengyi nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin kooron ma fwo kooron (736), ma akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ ɩgbaa isiyee ma nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin kooron (6,720), <verse eid="EZR 2:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="EZR 2:67" />ma abengyi nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ ma dikpilin ma fwo ton (435), ma akpɔŋɔ ɩgbaa isiyee ma nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin kooron (6,720).<verse eid="EZR 2:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="EZR 2:68" />Gɛtɛ bɛ ma gyu Yahwe dɩkpaara daanɩ Yerusalem fɔ, akpaara fɔ yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ bɛkɩ bɛ tɛ gedi gɛtɛ gi ye boo-ituru yaanɩ bàà biri sere Wurubwarɛ Dikwo fɔ dɩɩ dɩkpalan daanɩ. <verse eid="EZR 2:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="EZR 2:69" />Ɛkamasɛ ɛ tɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ talɩ ɛ tɛ tɛ gʋtʋn fɔ gɩɩ gɛmɛ. Bɛ tɛ sɩka-sɩya wanyan-kpara gɛtɛ à kʋla yɩ fɔ ɩ̀ ba asepekyi asiyee ma nkpɩn ton (61,000), ma sɩka-fututu ɩgbaa ɩnyɔɔ ma nkpɩn ton (5,000), ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bɔɔ ngba akpilin ton (100). <verse eid="EZR 2:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="EZR 2:70" />Gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, ma Lefi bete, ma ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ, ma otunu wʋʋ bɛdɩyɛlɛ, ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ bɛsaranyan, bɛ sara ɛbɛ gbagba baatele yaanɩ, fɩya ma bɛnɩ fɔ bɛkɩ. Gɛ Isareli bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ mɔ bɛ sara baatele yaanɩ.<verse eid="EZR 2:70" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZR 3" />
  <para style="s1">Be biri be sere Yahwe gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 3:1" />Gɛtɛ ebon-kwarankɩfɛ ɛ nɩma fɔ, Isareli bete fɔ powu bɛ wɛrɛ sara baatele yaanɩ, gɛ ɛbɛ powu be tuma Yerusalem anlɛ ɛnɩ-kɩlɩn. <verse eid="EZR 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 3:2" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yosadaki wobi Yesuwa ma wɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ, ma Seyalitiyeli wobi Serubabeli ma wɔ wɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ bɛ kya Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gii gesre, fɔ bàà tɩ tɛ gekuma gii gedi gii koro, anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwaralɛ bɛ sa Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ Mose wo-ise yaanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 3:3" />Ma gɛtɛ bè serenti bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be silin bɛ be tuma gba fɔ, be biri be sere gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gɩɩ geseregyagakʋn-kuba fɔ gii koro, gɛ bɛ tɛ Yahwe gekuma gii gedi gii koro gɛgyɩgyan ma ɔgyɔlɔ. <verse eid="EZR 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 3:4" />Be di Ɩpanpan Yaawi yii Gedi fɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa alɛ bàà ti di fɔ, ma gekuma gii gedi anlɛ gɛtɛ wù di gɛtɛ bàà tɛ duwi-kamasɛ fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 3:5" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, bɛ bɛ tɛ Yahwe duwi n di duwi dii gekuma gii gedi, ma ebon-fon gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀, ma Yahwe wawi-fɩrɩn-fɩrɩn yii gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀, ma gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gɛtɛ gi ye bɛnɩ fɔ gbagba boo-ituru yaanɩ. <verse eid="EZR 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 3:6" />Ebon-kwarankɩfɛ duwi-gyangbasɛlɛ daanɩ fɔ, be sere ɔpɩ gɛtɛ̀ Yahwe gekuma gii gedi, ma gɛtɛ bɛn tɛ kya Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii gesere gba fɔ.<verse eid="EZR 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛ kya Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii gebiri sere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 3:7" />Isareli bete fɔ bɛ tɛ bɛmaralɛ ma dikwo dɩɩ bɛgbɛrɛlɛ fɔ sɩka, gɛ bɛ tɛ Sidon bete ma Tire bete fɔ anyandilɛ, ma bʋkan, ma bʋnɔ fɔ bàà talɩ bɛ ka seda wo-iyon fɔ gyaga butu buu koro ye Lebanon san Yopa anlɛ gɛtɛ Perisi wogyu Sirusi ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ.<verse eid="EZR 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 3:8" />Gɛtɛ bɛ ba Wurubwarɛ Dikwo fɔ dɩɩ dɩkpalan fɔ daanɩ Yerusalem, gɩkyan-nyɔɔfɛ giibon-nyɔɔfɛ waanɩ fɔ, Sewalitiyeli wobi Serubabeli, ma Yosadaki wobi Yesuwa, ma bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, ma Lefi bete, ma ɛbɛ powu gɛtɛ nafɔ be ye gisela gaanɩ gɛ be biri bɛ ba Yerusalem fɔ, be sere gʋtʋn fɔ gɩɩpɩ. Gɛ Lefi bete powu gɛtɛ be di bɩkyan dikpilin ka san fɔ, bɛ ka bɛ bɛ sɩ̀ gɛtɛ bàà nya Wurubwarɛ Dikwo fɔ dɩɩ gʋtʋn fɔ gii koro. <verse eid="EZR 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 3:9" />Gɛ Yesuwa, ma wo bebi-teni, ma wɔndɩrɛ ɛbɛ, ma Kadimiweli, ma wo bebi-teni gɛtɛ bè di Hodafiya wodu wʋʋ bɛnɩ fɔ, ma Henadadi bebi-teni, ma boo bebi-teni, ma bɔɔdɩrɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bè di Lefi bete fɔ powu bɛ bɛ fɩya gɛ bɛɛ nya ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ Wurubwarɛ Dikwo daanɩ dɩɩ gʋtʋn fɔ boo koro.<verse eid="EZR 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 3:10" />Gɛtɛ bɛmaralɛ fɔ bɛ kya Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii gesere-gyagakʋn fɔ gii gesere fɔ, gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ bɛ sa bɔɔ ngba gɛ bè de baakantan, gɛ Asafi bebi gɛtɛ bè di Lefi bete fɔ, bè de baakyaka bè yela bàà sila Yahwe anlɛ gɛtɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi e wùlà fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 3:11" />Bɛɛ nʋma gesila ma onyun wʋʋ gɛsa wʋʋ-ɩnʋn bɛ tɛ Yahwe alan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZR 3:11">“Yahwe ɛ̀ kɔlɔ, gɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 3:11">wo gelen gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba tɛ Isareli fɔ gɩ̀ sa gakpaakpa.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZR 3:11">Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛkamasɛ ɛ gbɛrɛ afala e sila Yahwe yema bɛ kya Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩpɩ wuu gesere. <verse eid="EZR 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 3:12" />Gɛtɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, ma Lefi bete, ma akpaara yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ kpekpesi gɛtɛ be we Dikwo-kuba fɔ bɛ nya fɔ, be wula gepepe, ɔkʋna gɛtɛ be we gɛtɛ bee sere gesere-gyagakʋn-fon fɔ. Mɔ bekurumakyɛɛ fɔ bɩrɛ bɛɛ gbɛrɛ gɛ ɔsɛ wafala. <verse eid="EZR 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 3:13" />Ɔsɛ waafala fɔ ma gewula giiyo fɔ powu ɩɩ bʋn gatala gʋsɔ gɛtɛ ɛkɩ ɛn mɩnɩ talɩ nyɩnla alɛ ɔsɛ wuuyo n di nyayɩ abɛɛ gewula giiyo n di nyayɩ.<verse eid="EZR 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZR 4" />
  <para style="s1">Gɛtɔ-yela Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii gebiri-sere dii koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 4:1" />Gɛtɛ Yuda bete ma Benyamin bete bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ bɛ nʋn alɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be gye bɛ san gisela fɔ be biri bɛ ba bee sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ bàà tɛ Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ, <verse eid="EZR 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 4:2" />bɛ ba Serubabeli ma akpaara yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ baakʋn gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ alɛ, “Ɩ yɛ taà kpà yɩ, fɔ yàà sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ. Yema ɛtɩ ma ɛyɩ powu tɩɩ sʋma gɛ Wurubwarɛ-kɩlɩn, gɛ tɩɩ tɛ wɔ gedi ye sɩyɛɛ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Asiriya wogyu-dɩrɛ Esaradon ɛ ka tɩ ɛ bɛ sɩ̀ nfan fɔ.”<verse eid="EZR 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 4:3" />Mɔ Serubabeli, ma Yesuwa, ma Isareli wakpaara yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ be tiri wuunyun alan, “Tɩn taa hiyan yɩɩ gɛkpà taà ka ti sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ tɩ tɛ Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ. Taà sere dɩ taanyan anlɛ gɛtɛ Perisi wogyu-dɩrɛ Sirusi ɛ dɔ̀ tɩ fɔ.”<verse eid="EZR 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 4:4" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bè si gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gii koro fɔ bɛ kya gɛsa Yuda bete fɔ ɔyɔn ma gɩsaa gɛtɛ bɛ kara ni sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 4:5" />Bɛ tɛ bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Perisi wogyu-dɩrɛ gatɩn fɔ anyan dibilin daanɩ gɛtɛ bàà suguti baade-kamasɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ fɔ. Bɛ mɛ gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ ye Perisiya wogyu-dɩrɛ Sirusi wɔya gɛtɛ ɛ sara bugyu powu waanɩ ma Perisiya wogyu-dɩrɛ Dariwusi wɔya waanɩ.<verse eid="EZR 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gebiri tɔ-yela Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii gesere dii koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 4:6" />Gɛtɛ Herihesi ɛ bɔ ɛ kya bugyu buu gedi fɔ, Yuda ma Yerusalem bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ fɔ bɛ ŋwara gɩkpa bɛ bɛ tɛ egyu, gɛtɛ bè de ade bee tù Yuda ma Yerusalem bɛnɩ.<verse eid="EZR 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 4:7" />Gɛlɛ ke gɛ Perisiya wogyu-dɩrɛ Aritaserisi wɔya waanɩ fɔ, Bisilam, ma Mitiredati, ma Tabeeli ma bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛbɛ fɔ, bɛ ŋwara gɩkpa bɛ sama wɔ. Aram gɛŋwarabi gɛ bɛ ka bɛ ŋwara gɩkpa fɔ, gɛ bɛ ŋwara gɩ gɛ Aram ginde gaanɩ. <verse eid="EZR 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 4:8" />Gɛlɛ ke gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ wɔmalɛ Rehum, ma Simisayi gɛtɛ è di gɩkpa gɩɩŋwaralɛ fɔ, bɛ ŋwara gɩkpa bɛ mɩna Yerusalem bɛ ka bɛ san ma egyu-dɩrɛ Aritaserisi alan,<verse eid="EZR 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 4:9" />“Egyu-dɩrɛ wɔmalɛ Rehum ma gɩkpa gɩɩŋwaralɛ Simisayi fɩya ma bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛbɛ anlɛ gɔdɔ gɩɩ bɛdɔ̀lɛ, ma bɛndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya ye Tripoli, ma Perisiya, ma Ereki, ma Babilon, ma Elam bete gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Susa fɔ, <verse eid="EZR 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 4:10" />ma bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ba gebù-dɩrɛ gɛ Asuribanipali ɛ tɔ̀là bɛ ɛ san Samariya ditele ma Efrati getu-fèn.”<verse eid="EZR 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 4:11" />(Ade gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa gɩkpa gɛtɛ bɛ ka bɛ tɩyɛma egyu Aritaherisasi fɔ n tɛ ba lɛ).</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:11">Tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Aritaherisasi,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:11">“Ɛtɩ aa bɛsaranyan gɛtɛ tì si gbɛma Efrata fɔ n tɛ tɩyɛma wɔ̀ gɩkpa nyagɩ lɛ.<verse eid="EZR 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 4:12" />Tii len gɛtɛ awɔ egyu-dɩrɛ àà nyɩnla alɛ Yuda bete gɛtɛ be ye aakʋn bɛ ba taakʋn fɔ, bɛ san Yerusalem bee sere ditele gɛtɛ dɩɩ tɔ diyela bɛnɩ boo koro gɛ dɩ̀ ba duyu-kɛma fɔ. Be biri bee sere dɩɩpɔrɩ ma gesere-gyagakʋn fɔ.<verse eid="EZR 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 4:13" />Nkele mɔ tii len gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ àà nyɩnla alɛ gengyi bɛnɩ nyabɛ bè biri be sere ditele nyadɩ ma dɩɩpɔrɩ fɔ, ɛkɩ ɛn nan ni le lonpoo, gɛ bɛn nan le gɩkyan-gɩkyan gɩɩ sɩka abɛɛ sɩka belenlɛ-sɩ̀lɛ, gɛ egyu wɔ sɩka ade yaà ba gatɩn. <verse eid="EZR 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 4:14" />Nkele gɛtɛ tɩ̀ sa awɔ egyu àà gatɩn gɛ tiin len taà mɛ anlɛ tin bù wɔ̀, okoro gɛ tɩɩ ŋwara gɩkpa nyagɩ taà yɛ egyu àà nyɩnla, <verse eid="EZR 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 4:15" />fɔ àà yɛ bàà ma buguti ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be gyegeye wɔ̀ bɛ sara fɔ baakpa yaanɩ. Gɛlɛ gaakpa fɔ yaanɩ fɔ, aà we gɛtɛ ditele nyadɩ dɩɩ tɔ di yela bɛnɩ boo koro ɔya-kamasɛ, gɛ ye sɩyɛɛ wukukuba fɔ dɩɩ ka ade ma ade-bi dɩ mɔma begyu ma bɛndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ bɛ sara fɔ powu. Nyawʋ wuu koro gɛ be tì muru dɩ fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 4:16" />Tii len egyu-dɩrɛ àà nyɩnla alɛ gengyi bè sere ditele nyadɩ ma dɩɩpɔrɩ fɔ, an nan ni wura gedikʋn gɩkɩ a ye Efrata wofèn.”<verse eid="EZR 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 4:17" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ e tiri ade fɔ yiinyun ɛ tɩyɛma bɛ alan,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:17">“Ntɛ ŋwara gɩkpa nyagɩ n tɩyɛma egyu-dɩrɛ wɔmalɛ Rehum, ma gɩkpa gɩɩŋwaralɛ Simisaya, ma ɛbɛ powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛwɔ, gɛ bè si Samariya, ma Efrata gɩlan powu fɔ.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:17">Na sa yɩ onyun.<verse eid="EZR 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 4:18" />Gɩkpa gɛtɛ ɩ tɩyɛma mɩ fɔ, na yɛ be tiri gaanɩ bɛ ba Perisiya ginde gaanɩ gɛ bɛ kalan gɩ mɩɩn bʋnʋn baanɩ. <verse eid="EZR 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 4:19" />Okoro na yɛ bɛ ma bugiti akpa yaanɩ gɛ wu wùlà gɛtɛ, sɩyɛɛ wukukuba fɔ, ditele-dɩrɛ nyadɩ dɩɩ tɔ di yela begyu boo koro gɛ dì di gɛtɔ-yela ma ade ma ade-bi yii ditele. <verse eid="EZR 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 4:20" />Begyu-dɩrɛ ma ɔkɛma bɛ sara Yerusalem bɛ bɛ da, gɛ ɛbɛ na kpakya Efrata getu-fèn-do fɔ powu, gɛ be to lonpoo, ma gɩkyan-gɩkyan gɩɩ sɩka, ma sɩka-belenlɛ-sɩ̀lɛ ma anyan powu dʋkɔbɛ. <verse eid="EZR 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 4:21" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro ɩ tɛ bɛ ose bàà ten gʋtʋn fɔ ka ma sere gɛtɛ nan biri ntɛ ose-fon. <verse eid="EZR 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 4:22" />Ɩ nya gepe gɛtɛ ɩn nan gbɛlɩ ade nyayɩ. Anʋn yii koro gɛ yaà yɛ ade-kpen nyayɩ yàà bɛ mɛ ade-dɩrɛ, fɔ yàà ka dɩyɩyɛ mɔma egyu-dɩrɛ.”<verse eid="EZR 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 4:23" />Disere-kɩlɩn gɛtɛ bɛ kalan egyu-dɩrɛ Aritaserisi gɩkpa fɔ bɛ tɛ Rehum ma gɩkpa gɩɩŋwaralɛ Simisayi ma bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ fɔ, bɛ tɔ disere-kɩlɩn bɛ san Yuda bete baakʋn Yerusalem gɛ bɛ ma ten bɛ gʋtʋn fɔ gɩɩ gɛmɛ dɩkpankpasan daanɩ. <verse eid="EZR 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 4:24" />Okoro Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gʋtʋn gi ten ka ma sere Perisiya wogyu-dɩrɛ Dariwusi wo bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan-nyɔɔfɛ gaanɩ.<verse eid="EZR 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZR 5" />
  <para style="s1">Tatenayi ɛ ŋwara gɩkpa ɛ tɩyɛma egyu Dariwusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 5:1" />Wʋ bɛ ba gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ da ma wɔ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ Hagayi ma Ido wodu wʋʋnɩ Sekariya boo koro ɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ tɛ Yuda bete gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Yuda ma Yerusalem fɔ, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ è yela bɔɔ gama fɔ wo diyere daanɩ. <verse eid="EZR 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 5:2" />Gɛ Sewalitiyeli wobi Serubabeli ma Yasadaki wobi Yesuwa be biri bɛ san Wurubwarɛ dɩkpaara fɔ daanɩ gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Yerusalem fɔ, fɔ bàà biri kya dii gesere. Fɔ Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛbɛ bɛɛ kpà bɛ.<verse eid="EZR 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 5:3" />Ɔkʋna wʋtɔkɔ fɔ, Tatenayi gɛtɛ è di Efrati getu giifèn-do wʋʋnyalɛ fɔ, ma Setari-Bosenayi ma bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ fɔ, bɛ san baakʋn gɛ be lila bɛ alɛ, “Ɛnyan na tɛ yɩ osele gɛ i biri ii sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ yàà pɩna dɩ?” <verse eid="EZR 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 5:4" />Be biri be lila alɛ, ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bee sere dikwo fɔ baayere de? <verse eid="EZR 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 5:5" />Mɔ Wurubwarɛ ɛɛ nya Yuda bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ boo koro, okoro ben kere gʋtʋn fɔ gɩɩ gɛmɛ ya ka ma sere gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara gɩkpa bɛ sama egyu Dariwusi gɛ e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ bɛ.<verse eid="EZR 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 5:6" />Gɩkpa gɛtɛ Tatenayi wɔ gɩfɩɩ gɩɩnyalɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya Efrati, ma Setari-Bosenayi ma bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ, ma bɛndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ bè si gbɛma Efrati fɔ bɛ ŋwara bɛ tɩyɛma egyu Dariwusi fɔ n tɛ ba lɛ. <verse eid="EZR 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 5:7" />Gɩkpa fɔ gaade n di alan,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 5:7">Gɩkpa nyagɩ gɩɩ fɔrɔ gɩ tɛ egyu Dariwusi,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 5:7">Olila wʋ sara ma egyu Dariwusi.<verse eid="EZR 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 5:8" />Tii len egyu-dɩrɛ àà nyɩnla alɛ tɩ san Yuda wɔlanlan waanɩ gɛ ti ma we gɛtɛ bee sere Wurubwarɛ-Kpatakpɩrɩ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ ma ataa dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ, ma iyon atoo-atoo gɛtɛ bɛ ka bɛ gyaga ɩpɔrɩ yɩɩ koro. Bɛ ka koro bɛ tɛ gʋtʋn fɔ, gɛ gʋtʋn fɔ gɩɩ san bilen-bilen, yema bɛndɩrɛ bɛɛ nya gʋtʋn fɔ gii koro gepe.<verse eid="EZR 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 5:9" />Ti lila bɛndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya gʋtʋn fɔ gii koro fɔ alan, “Ɛnyan na tɛ yɩ osele gɛ ɩ pɩna ii sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ?” <verse eid="EZR 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 5:10" />Ti ni lila baayere, fɔ tàà wura ŋwara boo begyegeyelɛ baayere tɩ tɛ wɔ fɔ àà nyɩnla bɛ.<verse eid="EZR 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 5:11" />Be tiri wuunyun alan,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 5:11">“ Tì di gɛ gatala ma gɛtʋnkwaa gii Wurubwarɛ fɔ bɛsaranyan, gɛ tɩ pɩna tii sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛkɩ e sere dɩ e were bɩkyan kpekpesi bʋkɩ bʋ lɛ. <verse eid="EZR 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 5:12" />Mɔ gɛtɛ tiitu ɛbɛ bɛ sa Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa gatala fɔ owurufa okoro, e tiri bɛ ɛ tɛ Babilon wogyu Kalide-te Nebukadinesa gɛ e gbena Dikwo-dɩrɛ nyadɩ gɛ e gye dɩɩ bɛnɩ ɛ da Babilon.<verse eid="EZR 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 5:13" />Mɔ Babilon wogyu-dɩrɛ Sirusi bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan-gyangbasɛlɛ gaanɩ fɔ, ɛ tɛ ose gɛtɛ bàà biri sere Wurubwarɛ dikwo fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 5:14" />Gɛ e birima sɩka-sɩya, ma sɩka-fututu, ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanyan gɛtɛ Nebukadinesa ɛ ka e ye Yerusalem Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ ɛ ma sɩ̀ Babilon dikpen-kwo daanɩ, fɔ ɛ tɛ̀ ete gɛtɛ bee kpèlè alɛ, Sesibasa gɛtɛ e tiri wɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ ɔlanlan wʋkɩ wʋʋnyalɛ fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 5:15" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, “To anyan nyayɩ fɔ àà ka yɩ ma sɩ̀ Yerusalem Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. Fɔ yàà biri sere Wurubwarɛ dikwo fɔ dii dìtìngbìlìn fɔ daanɩ.<verse eid="EZR 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 5:16" />Okoro Sesibasa ɛ ba, gɛ ɛ bɛ kya Yerusalem Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii gesere-gyagakʋn. Ye duwi dɩtɔkɔ bè sere ma ǹdò fɔ bɛ̀ sa dii gesere gaanɩ mɔ din te were.”<verse eid="EZR 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 5:17" />Okoro gengyi awɔ egyu aà yera fɔ, ɛ yɛ bàà ma buguti Babilon bugyu baakpa yaanɩ bɛ nya alɛ egyu Sirusi ɛn ŋwara gɩkpa gɛtɛ gii wùlà alɛ bàà sere Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ? Fɔ awɔ egyu àà yɛ tɩ taà nyɩnla aamɩnlɛ ade nyayɩ yaanɩ.<verse eid="EZR 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZR 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ose gɛtɛ egyu Dariwusi ɛ tɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 6:1" />Egyu Dariwusi ɛ yɛ bɛ ma bugiti Babilon wakpa-dɩrɛ yaanɩ, anyan gbagba yɩɩ gɛsɩ̀kʋn. <verse eid="EZR 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 6:2" />Gɛ bɛ ma ye gɩkpa gɩkɩ koro Ekibatana ditele gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Mediya gɩlan fɔ daanɩ. Bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa gaanɩ alan,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 6:2">“Gɛtabʋrʋ ka dama gɩkpa fɔ gii koro.”<verse eid="EZR 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 6:3" />Egyu Sirusi wo bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan gyangbasɛlɛ gaanɩ fɔ, ɛ ŋwara ose ɛ dama Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Yerusalem fɔ dii koro alan,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 6:3">&lt;Wù di gɛtɛ bàà biri sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ, fɔ wàà mɛ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ baà tɩ tɛ gedi, okoro ɩ yɛ bàà kya dii gesere-gyagakʋn wuu gesere. Wù di gɛtɛ daatɔ dàà mɛ bɩsɩrɩ akpilin anaa ma fwo fɔ daayɛrɛ dàà mɛ bɩsɩrɩ akpilin anaa ma fwo. <verse eid="EZR 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 6:4" />Baà sere ataa ɩgba isiyee fɔ bɛ be sere timba ɔgba wʋkɩ. Egyu dɩdaka daanɩ gɛ kɔba fɔ eè ye bàà ka nya gʋtʋn fɔ gii koro. <verse eid="EZR 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 6:5" />Gɛlɛ ke gɛ wù di gɛtɛ egyu Nebukadinesa ɛ̀ birima Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ dɩɩ sɩka-sɩya ma dɩɩ sɩka-fututu wanyan gɛtɛ ɛ ka e ye Yerusalem ɛ san Babilon fɔ ɛ bɛ sɩ̀ yɩɩ gɛdʋrɔkʋn Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. Wù di gɛtɛ yàà dʋrʋ Wurubwarɛ dɩkpaara fɔ daanɩ.<verse eid="EZR 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 6:6" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro, ye ǹdò ka san fɔ, awɔ Tatenayi gɛtɛ aa nya Efrati getu-fèn ka san fɔ, ma Seta-Bosenayi fɩya ma aa bɛndɩrɛbi, ɩ ta nɩ gbɛma Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 6:7" />I tiri yaalɔ i ye Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ dii gʋtʋn fɔ gaanɩ. Ɩ yɛ Yuda gɛtʋnkwaa gɩɩnyalɛ ma gɩɩ bɛndɩrɛbi bàà biri sere Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii dìtìngbilìn daanɩ.<verse eid="EZR 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 6:8" />Ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wù biri wʋ̀ fɩya fɔ, n di alɛ, n tɛ tɛ yɩ ose alɛ, ɩ kpà Yuda bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ, fɔ bàà sere Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩkpaara fɔ.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 6:8">I tiri kɔba i ye egyu gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya Efrati getu giifèn-do fɔ wɔ gɛbɩya gaanɩ yàà ka nya bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ bɛ mɛ gʋtʋn fɔ boo koro, fɔ gʋtʋn fɔ gɩ kara bè ten. <verse eid="EZR 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 6:9" />Anyan gɛtɛ ii hiyan bàà ka tɛ Gatala gii Wurubwarɛ gekuma gii gedi fɔ n di, ɛkwɔ-teni, ma ɛyɛran-teni, ma bɛyɛran-nanɩ, ma afɩnaa, ma bʋbɔlɛ, ma wayɩn ma bʋnɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ Yerusalem gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ be lila bàà tɩ tɛ bɛ duwi n di duwi fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 6:10" />Ɩ mɛ gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ ɩ tɛ bɛ fɔ bàà talɩ bɛ tɛ Gatala gɩɩ Wurubwarɛ gedi gɛtɛ gaà di wɔ gʋnʋn, fɔ bàà tiri onyun egyu ma wo bebi-teni bɔɔ nkpa wo koro.<verse eid="EZR 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 6:11" />Ǹ biri n tɛ sɩ̀ ose alɛ, gengyi ɛnɩ ɛkɩ en di ose nyawʋ wuu koro fɔ, baà dugba wo dikwo diiyon wʋkɩ gɛ baà salɩ wʋ fɔ bàà ka ɛnɩ fɔ tʋlʋn ma ɛwʋ. Gɛ baà gbena ɛnɩ fɔ dikwo dʋgʋ-dʋgʋ. <verse eid="EZR 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 6:12" />Egyu-dɩrɛ-kamasɛ abɛɛ gɩfɩɩ gɛtɛ gaà dɔ̀ alɛ gii foma ose nyawʋ abɛɛ gàà mɩna Dikwo-dɩrɛ nyadɩ Yerusalem fɔ, Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ e tiri dʋkɔbɛ gɛtɛ bɛnɩ bàà tɩ sʋma wɔ fɔ ɛ yɛ gɩ gàà nʋ̀n.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 6:12">Nmɩ Dariwusi na sɩ̀ ose nyawʋ. Wù di gɛtɛ ɛnɩ-kamasɛ èè di wuu koro kyɛkyɛ.<verse eid="EZR 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Be sere Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ be were gɛ bɛ ka dɩ bɛ sa Wurubwarɛ gʋlɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 6:13" />Ose gɛtɛ egyu Dariwusi ɛ tɛ fɔ, Efrati getu-fèn-do gɩɩnyalɛ Tatenayi ma Setari-Bosanayi ma bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ be di wuu koro kyɛkyɛ. <verse eid="EZR 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 6:14" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro Yuda bɛndɩrɛbi bɛ kyaga dikwo fɔ dii gesere, gɛ dɩɩ san bʋnʋn. Fɔ Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ Hagayi ma Sekariya gɛtɛ e ye Ido wodu waanɩ fɔ bɛ tabʋrʋ bɛ sa bɛ ɔkɛma. Gɛ be werema dikwo fɔ dii gesere anlɛ gɛtɛ Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ ɛ dɔ̀, gɛ Perisiya begyu Sirusi, ma Dariwusi, ma Aritaserisi bɛ tɛ ose fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 6:15" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Dariwusi bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan-kooronfɛ, Ada wobon duwi-siyefɛ daanɩ gɛ be werema Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ.<verse eid="EZR 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 6:16" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Isareli bɛnɩ fɔ powu (gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, ma Lefi bete ma ɛbɛ powu gɛtɛ be gye bɛ san gisela fɔ), bɛ mɛ Wurubwarɛ Dikwo fɔ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn gɛ be di ɔsɛ. <verse eid="EZR 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 6:17" />Bɛ ka bɛkwɔ-teni akpilin ton (100), ma ayɛran-gbʋgbʋ gɛkpɩn (200), ma bɛyɛran atan-teni nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ (400) bɛ ka be tiri Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ okòro. Bɛ ka begbebi-teni fwo bɛnyɔɔ bɛ tɛ ade-kpen yɩɩ gɛkakyɛ yii gedi tɛ Isareli powu, ɛkamasɛ è yela ɛ tɛ Isareli wo-ifoli fwo ɩnyɔɔ waanɩ wʋkɩ fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 6:18" />Ɛwʋ gɛ be yo gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bɛ sa baakpen-akpen yaanɩ, gɛ be yo Lefi bete mɔ bɛ sa baakpen-akpen yaanɩ tɛ Wurubwarɛ gʋtʋn fɔ gɩɩ gɛmɛ Yerusalem anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara bɛ sa Mose gɩkpa gaanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="EZR 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gɛkààrà-da</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 6:19" />Ebon gyangbasɛlɛ wo duwi fwo-naafɛ daanɩ fɔ, bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be gye gisela fɔ, be di Gɛkààrà-da gɩɩsɛ. <verse eid="EZR 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 6:20" />Gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma Lefi bete fɔ powu bɛ kpa koro dɩdɩɩ bɛ mɛ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn. Gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ be belen Gɛkààrà-da gɩɩyɛran fɔ duyu bɛ tɛ bɛnɩ powu gɛtɛ be gye gisela fɔ, ma bɔɔdɩrɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bè di gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ, ma ɛbɛ gbagba boo koro. <verse eid="EZR 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 6:21" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be gye gisela fɔ, be di anyan fɔ, ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be tiri koro be ye bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛn nyɩ̀ Wurubwarɛ fɔ, bɔɔ dɩdɩɩ daade-mɛlɛ fɔ. Fɔ bàà talɩ sʋma Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ. <verse eid="EZR 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 6:22" />Bɛ ka awi kwarankɩ be di Boroboro gɛtɛ bɛn sa gɩfa-ŋanlɛ Wɔsɛ wuu Gedi, yema Yahwe ɛ yɛ be di ɔsɛ dɩrɛ gɛtɛ e foma Asiriya wogyu wamɩnlɛ gɛ ɛ kpà bɛ Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gʋtʋn gaanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="EZR 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZR 7" />
  <para style="s1">Esira e be gyu Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 7:1" />Ade nyayɩ powu yɩɩ gama, ɔya gɛtɛ Perisiya wogyu Aritaserisi ee di bugyu fɔ, fɔ Esira e ye Babilon ɛ ba Yerusalem. Esira wote n di Seraya gɛ Seraya wote n di Asariya, Asariya wote n di Hilikiya, <verse eid="EZR 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 7:2" />Hilikiya wote n di Salum, Salum wote n di Sadoki, Sadoki wote n di Ahitubi, <verse eid="EZR 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 7:3" />Ahitubi wote n di Amariya, Amariya wote n di Asariya, Asariya wote n di Merayoti, <verse eid="EZR 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 7:4" />Merayoti wote n di Seraya, Seraya wote n di Usi, Usi wote n di Buki, <verse eid="EZR 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 7:5" />Buki wote n di Abisuwa, Abisuwa wote n di Finehasi, Finehasi wote n di gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ɛndɩrɛ Aaron wobi Eleyasa. <verse eid="EZR 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 7:6" />Esira nyawɔ ɛ tɔ e ye Babilon ɛ ba. È di gɛ Mose Wo-ise, gɛtɛ Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ ɛ tɛ fɔ wuu wùlàlɛ, gɛ ɛ gya waanɩ. Egyu ɛ tɛ wɔ gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ e lila fɔ, yema Yahwe, wo Wurubwarɛ gʋlɔ gɩ̀ gyaga wo koro. <verse eid="EZR 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 7:7" />Isareli bɛnɩ bɛkɩ fɩya ma gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ, ma Lefi bete, ma ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ, ma otunu wʋʋ bɛdɩyɛlɛ, ma Dikwo-dɩrɛ dɩɩ gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ, mɔ bɛ ba Yerusalem, egyu Ariteserisi wo bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan kwarankɩfɛ gaanɩ.<verse eid="EZR 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 7:8" />Babilon wogyu-dɩrɛ bugyu buu gedi wʋʋ gɩkyan kwarankɩfɛ giibon tonfɛ anɩ gɛ Esira e be gyu Yerusalem. <verse eid="EZR 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 7:9" />Esira ɛ kya wosele wʋʋ-ɩsan e ye Babilon, ebon gyangbasɛ wo duwi gyangbasɛlɛ daanɩ gɛ e be gyu Yerusalem ebon tonfɛ wo duwi gyangbasɛlɛ daanɩ yema wo Wurubwarɛ ɛ̀ fɩya ɛwɔ. <verse eid="EZR 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 7:10" />Esira ɛ ka wo koro powu ɛ tɛ Yahwe Wose fɔ wʋʋ gɛkasɩ ma wuu koro wuu gedi, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ talɩ wùlà wade-wùlàlɛ ma ise fɔ Isareli anɩ.<verse eid="EZR 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Egyu Aritaserisi ɛ ŋwara gɩkpa ɛ tɩyɛma Esira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 7:11" />Gɩkpa gɛtɛ egyu Aritaserisi ɛ ŋwara ɛ tɩyɛma Esira gɛtɛ è di gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ, ma ewùlàlɛ gɛ ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ Yahwe wo-ise ma wade wùlàlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ ka ɛ tɛ Isareli bete fɔ, n tɛ ba lɛ.<verse eid="EZR 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 7:12" />“Nmɩ Aritaserisi, begyu boogyu-dɩrɛ, n tɛ ŋwara gɩkpa nyagɩ n tɛ awɔ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Esira gɛtɛ à di Gatala gii Wurubwarɛ fɔ wose wuu wùlàlɛ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 7:12">N tɛ sa wɔ onyun.<verse eid="EZR 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 7:13" />Nkele n tɛ ose alan, Isareli-nɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa miin bugyu baanɩ fɔ, fɩya ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, ma Lefi bete gɛtɛ bee len bàà tɛrɛma wɔ san Yerusalem fɔ, bɛ̀ talɩ bɛ san. <verse eid="EZR 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 7:14" />Yema nmɩ egyu-dɩrɛ fɩya ma maamɩnlɛ yɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ kwarankɩ n tɛ sa wɔ àà ma lila anlɛ gɛtɛ Yerusalem ma Yuda i we fɔ àà nya anlɛ gɛtɛ bee di aa Wurubwarɛ Wose gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa aa gʋlɔ gaanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 7:15" />Wù di gɛtɛ àà ka sɩka-fututu ma sɩka-sɩya gɛtɛ nmɩ egyu ma maamɩnlɛ yɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ tɩ tɛ Isareli, wo Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ wo Dikwo-dɩrɛ dɩ̀ sa Yerusalem fɔ, <verse eid="EZR 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 7:16" />fɩya ma sɩka-fututu ma sɩka-sɩya powu gɛtɛ a wura a ye Babilon gɩlan, fɩya ma ɛwʋ gɛtɛ aa bɛnɩ ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bɛ tɛ be ye booturu waanɩ tɛ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Yerusalem fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 7:17" />Ka sɩka fɔ se bɛkwɔ-teni, ma ayɛran-gbʋgbʋ, ma bɛyɛran atan fɩya ma anyan yaabi yii gedi, ma bʋkan buu gedi, fɔ yàà ka yɩ tɛ gedi Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Yerusalem dii gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gii koro.<verse eid="EZR 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 7:18" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, awɔ ma aawɔlɔn ɛbɛ Yuda bete ɩ̀ talɩ ɩ ka sɩka-fututu ma sɩka-sɩya-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ ɩ mɛ gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ i we gɛtɛ wʋ̀ kɔlɔ tɛ yɩ gɛ wʋ̀ kɔlɔ tɛ Wurubwarɛ fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 7:19" />Ka anyɩmɩnyan powu gɛtɛ tɩ ka tɩ sa aagʋlɔ lɛ ma tɛ Yerusalem wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ, fɔ bàà ka mɛ gʋtʋn Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="EZR 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 7:20" />Gɛ gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ gaà biri gi hiyan yɩɩ Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ, ɩ̀ talɩ i tiri kɔba i ye gigyu-bɩya gaanɩ.<verse eid="EZR 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 7:21" />“Nkele nmɩ egyu Aritaserisi, n tɛ dɔ̀ ɛyɩ Efrati getu gɩɩ gɩlan gɩɩ bɛndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ bɛɛ nya kɔba wade yii koro fɔ alɛ, ɩ tɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ ma gatala gii Wurubwarɛ wo-ise yiiwùlàlɛ Esira gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ eè lila yɩ <verse eid="EZR 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 7:22" />ka ma sere sɩka-fututu bekotoku akpilin ton, ma ɔnʋmʋ-sʋnlɛ bekotoku akpilin ton (100), ma wayɩn bɛgalɔn nkpɩn bisiyee (600) ma olife bʋnɔ bɛgalɔn nkpɩn bisiyee (600), ma bʋbɔlɛ baasɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ è len. <verse eid="EZR 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 7:23" />Gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ gatala gii Wurubwarɛ fɔ e wùlà alɛ èè len wo Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ fɔ, ɩ mɛ wʋ gɛlɛ kyɛkyɛ. Anʋn yii koro gɛ wowurufa waà ba nmɩ ma miin bebi tii bugyu boo koro? <verse eid="EZR 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 7:24" />N te len yàà nyɩnla alɛ ɩn ma osele yàà to lonpoo, abɛɛ gɩkyan gɩɩ sɩka, abɛɛ sɩka belenlɛ-sɩ̀lɛ ɩ sɩ̀ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ, abɛɛ Lefi bete, abɛɛ ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ fɔ, abɛɛ otunu wʋʋ bɛdɩyɛlɛ fɔ, abɛɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ, abɛɛ gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Wurubwarɛ dɩkpaara daanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="EZR 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 7:25" />Gɛ awɔ Esira, ka gɛsɛyɩ gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ̀ fɔ tiri gɔdɔ gɩɩ bɛdɔ̀lɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ nyɩ̀ aa Wurubwarɛ wo-ise fɔ yaanɩ fɔ bàà dɔ̀ bɛnɩ powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Efrati getu-fèn, ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ nyɩ Wurubwarɛ wo-ise fɔ powu bɔɔ gɛdɔ̀, fɔ àà wùlà ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛn nyɩ yɩ fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 7:26" />Ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛn nan di aa Wurubwarɛ wose ma egyu-dɩrɛ wose fɔ, baà mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩɩ ba lɛ yaanɩ wʋkɩ bɛ ka be tiira wɔ giten. Baà wolo wɔ, abɛɛ baà berema wɔ ditele fɔ daanɩ, abɛɛ baà to wanyan powu gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba, abɛɛ baà tan wɔ dikwo.<verse eid="EZR 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 7:27" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Esira ɛ dɔ̀ alɛ, “I sila Yahwe, tiitu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛ ka ade nyayɩ ɛ sa egyu woturu waanɩ gɛ ɛ ka gebù ɛ tɛ Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ Yerusalem, <verse eid="EZR 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 7:28" />gɛ e tiri wo gelen e wùlà mɩ egyu ma wamɩnlɛ yɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi ma ɔkɛmalɛ bɔɔ bʋnʋn fɔ. Yema Yahwe miin Wurubwarɛ ɛ̀ fɩya ma nmɩ. Gɛlɛ wuu koro na gbɛrɛ oturu gɛ na kʋla Isareli begyegeyelɛ powu gɛ bɛ bɛ fɩya ma nmɩ gɛ tɩ san Yerusalem.”<verse eid="EZR 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZR 8" />
  <para style="s1">Akpaara yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛ fɩya ma Esira gɛ be biri bɛ ba fɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 8:1" />Akpaara yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ bɛ ŋwara baayere gɛtɛ bɛ fɩya ma Esira gɛ be ye Babilon bɛ ba Yerusalem, Egyu-dɩrɛ Aritaserisi wo bugyu buu gedi bʋʋya waanɩ fɔ baayere n tɛ ba lɛ.<verse eid="EZR 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 8:2" />Ɛwɔ gɛtɛ è di ɛndɩrɛ Finehasi wodu waanɩ fɔ n di Gerisom,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 8:2">ɛwɔ gɛtɛ è di ɛndɩrɛ Itama wodu waanɩ fɔ n di Daniyeli,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 8:2">ɛwɔ gɛtɛ è di ɛndɩrɛ Dafidi wodu waanɩ fɔ n di Hatusi, <verse eid="EZR 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 8:3" />gɛtɛ è di gɛ Sekaniya wobi fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 8:3">ɛwɔ gɛtɛ è di ɛndɩrɛ Parosi wodu waanɩ fɔ n di Sekaniya. Gɛ bɛ ŋwara beteni akpilin kwarankɩ ma fwo (150) baayere bɛ fɩya ma ɛbɛ.<verse eid="EZR 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 8:4" />ɛwɔ gɛtɛ è di ɛndɩrɛ Patati-Mowabi wodu waanɩ fɔ, n di Seraya wobi Eliyehoyenayi. Gɛ bɛ ŋwara beteni gɛkpɩn baayere bɛ fɩya ma ɛwɔ,<verse eid="EZR 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 8:5" />ɛwɔ gɛtɛ è di ɛndɩrɛ Satu wodu waanɩ fɔ, n di Yahasiyeli wobi-teni Sekaniya. Gɛ bɛ ŋwara beteni gɛkpɩn ma akpilin ton (300) baayere bɛ fɩya ma ɛwɔ,<verse eid="EZR 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 8:6" />ɛwɔ gɛtɛ è di ɛndɩrɛ Adin wodu waanɩ fɔ, n di Yonathan wobi Ebedi. Gɛ bɛ ŋwara beteni akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo baayere bɛ fɩya ma ɛwɔ,<verse eid="EZR 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 8:7" />ɛwɔ gɛtɛ è di ɛndɩrɛ Elam wodu waanɩ fɔ, n di Ataliya wobi-teni Yesaya. Gɛ bɛ ŋwara beteni akpilin asiyee ma fwo baayere bɛ fɩya ma ɛwɔ,<verse eid="EZR 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 8:8" />ɛwɔ gɛtɛ è di ɛndɩrɛ Sefatiya wodu waanɩ fɔ, n di Mikayeli wobi-teni Sebadiya. Gɛ bɛ ŋwara beteni akpilin anaa baayere bɛ fɩya ma ɛwɔ,<verse eid="EZR 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 8:9" />ɛwɔ gɛtɛ è di ɛndɩrɛ Yowabi wodu waanɩ fɔ, n di Yetiyeli wobi Obadiya. Gɛ bɛ ŋwara beteni gɛkpɩn ma fwo nɩyɛ baayere bɛ fɩya ma ɛwɔ,<verse eid="EZR 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 8:10" />ɛwɔ gɛtɛ è di ɛndɩrɛ Bani wodu waanɩ fɔ, n di Yosifiya wobi-teni Selomiti. Gɛ bɛ ŋwara beteni akpilin kooron (160) baayere bɛ fɩya ma ɛwɔ,<verse eid="EZR 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 8:11" />ɛwɔ gɛtɛ è di ɛndɩrɛ Bebayi wodu waanɩ fɔ, n di Babayi wobi-teni Sekariya. Gɛ bɛ ŋwara beteni dikpilin ma nɩyɛ baayere bɛ fɩya ɛwɔ,<verse eid="EZR 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 8:12" />ɛwɔ gɛtɛ è di ɛndɩrɛ Asigadi wodu waanɩ fɔ n di, Hakatan wobi-teni Yohanan. Gɛ bɛ ŋwara beteni akpilin ton ma fwo (110) baayere bɛ fɩya ma ɛwɔ,<verse eid="EZR 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 8:13" />Adonikam wodu waanɩ fɔ, ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ wɔ gama fɔ, baayere n di, Elifeleti, ma Yewuheli, ma Semahiya. Gɛ bɛ ŋwara beteni akpilin asiyee baayere bɛ fɩya ma ɛbɛ, <verse eid="EZR 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 8:14" />Bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be ye Bigifayi wodu waanɩ fɔ, n di Utayi ma Sakuri. Gɛ bɛ ŋwara beteni akpilin asiyee ma fwo baayere bɛ fɩya ma ɛbɛ.<verse eid="EZR 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gebiri ba Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 8:15" />Na kpèlè bɛ na tuma butu gɛtɛ bɩɩ da san Ahafa fɔ, gɛ tɩ sara dʋkɔbɛ awi asiyee. Gɛtɛ na nya bɛnɩ fɔ ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ baanɩ fɔ, min we Lefi-te ɛkɩ dʋkɔ. <verse eid="EZR 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 8:16" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro, nan kpèlè Eliyeseri, ma Ariyeli, ma Semaya, ma Elinatan, ma Yaribi, ma Elinatan, ma Natan, ma Sekariya ma Mesulam gɛtɛ bè di begyegeyelɛ fɔ, ma Yoyaribi ma Elinatan gɛtɛ bè di gɩkpa gɩɩ bɛnyɩnlalɛ-dɩrɛ, <verse eid="EZR 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 8:17" />gɛ na sa bɛ Kasifiya ditele dɩɩndɩrɛ Ido wakʋn. Na dɔ̀ bɛ ɛwʋ gɛtɛ baà dɔ̀ Ido ma wɔ bɛfʋrɩ ma gʋtʋn gɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Kasifiya ditele Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ, fɔ bàà ka bɛnɩ mɔma tɩ tɛ Wurubwarɛ dikwo fɔ, gɛtɛ bàà mɛ gʋtʋn dɩkpaara fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="EZR 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 8:18" />Gɛtɛ tɩɩ Wurubwarɛ ɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛtɩ okoro, bɛ ka Serebiya gɛtɛ wamɩnlɛ ɩ̀ dɔ̀ fɔ gɛ e ye Lefi wobi Mahili gɛtɛ wotu n di Isareli fɔ wodu waanɩ, ma ɛwɔ Serebiya bebi ma wɔdɩrɛ ɛbɛ bɛ mɔ ma tɩ. Ɛbɛ powu bɛ ba beteni fwo-nɩyɛ. <verse eid="EZR 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 8:19" />Ɛbɛ ma Hasabiya, fɩya ma Yesaya gɛtɛ e ye Merari wodu waanɩ fɔ, ma wɔdɩrɛ ɛbɛ, ma boo bebi, ma wokperebi ɛbɛ. Gɛ ɛbɛ powu bɛ ba beteni dikpilin. <verse eid="EZR 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 8:20" />Be biri bɛ ka bɛnɩ gɛkpɩn ma dikpilin (220) bɛ tɩyɛma gɛtɛ bàà bɛ mɛ gʋtʋn Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. Ɛbɛ n di bɛnɩ gɛtɛ Dafidi ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi be tiri bɛ sɩ̀ bàà tɩ̀ kpà Lefi bete gʋtʋn. Bɛ ŋwara ɛbɛ powu baayere.<verse eid="EZR 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 8:21" />Ahafa getu-kere dʋkɔ gɛ na dɔ̀ gɛtɛ taà ban onyun fɔ tàà warama koro gatɩn Yahwe bʋnʋn, fɔ taà fɔ wɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ dɩyɛ ɛtɩ ma tii bebi ma taanyan powu tiisele wuu-ɩsan fɔ waanɩ. <verse eid="EZR 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 8:22" />Wʋ mɛ mɩ ɩnɩnfa gɛtɛ nan lila egyu alɛ ɛ tɛ tɩ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ, ma abengyi yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ, gɛtɛ bàà dɩyɛ tɩ osele waanɩ tɩɩ bɛkyʋnlɛ boo koro. Yema tɩ wɛrɛ dɔ̀ wɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ tɩɩ Wurubwarɛ ɛɛ kpà ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bè lila wɔ gɛkpa fɔ, mɔ wowurufa wʋʋ tɔ ɛwɔ gɛtɛ è fi gama e ten wɔ fɔ wo koro. <verse eid="EZR 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 8:23" />Okoro tɩ ban onyun gɛ ti tiri onyun tɩ tɛ Wurubwarɛ ade nyayɩ yii koro, gɛ ɛ nʋn tiinyun-tiri.<verse eid="EZR 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 8:24" />Ɛwʋ gɛ na tiri gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ gɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ fwo bɛnyɔɔ gɛtɛ bɛ gya gʋtʋn fɔ gaanɩ fɩya ma Serebiya, ma Hasabiya, ma bɔɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ fwo, <verse eid="EZR 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 8:25" />gɛ na keri sɩka-fututu, ma sɩka-sɩya, ma anyan-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ egyu ma wamɩnlɛ yɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi, ma Isareli powu bɛ tɛ tɛ Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ gʋtʋn fɔ, na tɛ bɛ. <verse eid="EZR 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 8:26" />Anyan gɛtɛ na keri fɔ ɩ ba sɩka-fututu wanyɩmɩnyan bekotoku nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo (650), sɩka-fututu wanyan mɔ ɩ̀ ba bekotoku akpilin ton (100), sɩka-sɩya ɛ̀ ba bekotoku akpilin ton (100), <verse eid="EZR 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 8:27" />ma sɩka-sɩya bemudu dikpilin gɛtɛ wʋʋdʋrʋ wʋ̀ ba bekilo nɩyɛ ma ɔfan, ma anyɩmɩnyan anyɔɔ-kpara gɛtɛ bɛ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya bɛ mɛ yɩ gɛ ɩ̀ ba ɔyɛkɛma anlɛ sɩka-sɩya fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 8:28" />Na dɔ̀ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ alɛ, “Bɛ mɛ ɛyɩ ma anyan nyayɩ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn bɛ tɛ Yahwe. Sɩka-fututu ma sɩka-sɩya fɔ ì di gɛ gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gɛtɛ gi ye oturu waanɩ tɛ̀ Yahwe, yiitu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 8:29" />I nya anyan fɔ yii koro gepepe ka ma sere gɛtɛ yaà keri yɩ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daakwo yaanɩ, gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, ma Lefi bete, ma Isareli wakpaara yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛbi bɔɔ bʋnʋn Yahwe dɩkpaara gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Yerusalem fɔ daanɩ.” <verse eid="EZR 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 8:30" />Ɛwʋ gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ ma Lefi bete fɔ be to sɩka-fututu, ma sɩka-sɩya, ma anyɩmɩnyan fɩrɩnfɩrɩn gɛtɛ bɛ keri yɩ Wurubwarɛ Dikwo daanɩ Yerusalem fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 8:31" />Ebon-gyangbasɛ wo duwi fwo-nyɔɔfɛ daanɩ gɛ tɩ tɔ ti ye Ahafa getu giinyun fɔ gɩɩpɩ tɩɩ fɔrɔ Yerusalem. Tii Wurubwarɛ ɛ kpà tɩ gɛ e tiri tɩ e ye tɩɩ bɛkyʋnlɛ ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bee tin osele waanɩ fɔ baalɔ yaanɩ osele fɔ wʋʋ-ɩsan powu yaanɩ. <verse eid="EZR 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 8:32" />Tɩ ma gyu Yerusalem gɛ tɩ sara dʋkɔ ti tuna awi asiyee. <verse eid="EZR 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 8:33" />Duwi-naafɛ fɔ, tɩ keri sɩka-fututu, ma sɩka-sɩya, ma anyɩmɩnyan fɩrɩnfɩrɩn Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ gɛ bɛ ka yɩ bɛ sa Uriya wobi Meremoti gɛtɛ è di gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ fɔ walɔ yaanɩ. Finehasi wobi Eleyasa ɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛwɔ, fɩya ma Yesuwa wobi Yosabadi gɛtɛ è di Lefi-te fɔ, ma Binuwi wobi Nowadiya. <verse eid="EZR 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 8:34" />Bɛ kalan gɩnyan-kamasɛ ma gaasɔ, ma gɩɩdʋrʋ gɛ bɛ ŋwara ɔdʋrʋ fɔ powu bɛ sɩ̀ ɔya wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ.<verse eid="EZR 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 8:35" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be gye gisela fɔ, bɛ ka bɛkwɔ-teni fwo bɛnyɔɔ, ma ayɛran-gbʋgbʋ akpilin anaa ma fwo-kooron, ma bɛyɛran-teni akpilin asiyee ma fwo kwarankɩ bɛ tɛ Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ fɔ gekuma gii gedi. Gɛ bɛ ka begbebi-teni fwo-bɛnyɔɔ bɛ tɛ ade-kpen yɩɩ gɛkakyɛ yii gedi. Ɛyɩ nyayɩ powu ì di gɛ gekuma gii gedi tɛ Yahwe. <verse eid="EZR 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 8:36" />Bɛ ka egyu-dɩrɛ gɩkpa fɔ bɛ san ma Efrati getu giifèn-do gii begyegeyelɛ ma bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ, gɛ ɛbɛ mɔ bɛ kpà bɛnɩ fɔ ma Wurubwarɛ Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dii gesere.<verse eid="EZR 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZR 9" />
  <para style="s1">Esira wonyun-tiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 9:1" />Ade nyayɩ yɩɩ gama fɔ, begyegeyelɛ fɔ bɛ ba maakʋn gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, “Isareli bɛnɩ, fɩya ma gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, ma Lefi bete fɔ ben tiri koro ye bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bè si ma ɛbɛ fɔ baade-kyʋnlɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ, anlɛ gɛtɛ Kana bete, ma Hiti bete, ma Perisi bete, ma Yebusi bete, ma Amon bete, ma Mowabi bete, ma Egyipiti bete, ma Amori bete bɛɛ mɛ fɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="EZR 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 9:2" />Ɛbɛ ma boo bebi-teni bɛ ka boo bebi-nanɩ be to gɩna gɛ wʋ yɛ bɛnɩ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn fɔ be sugba ma bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bè si silin bɛ fɔ. Boo begyegeyelɛ ma bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛbi na gyegeye bɔɔ bʋnʋn gɛ bɛ mɛ ade nyayɩ gɛtɛ ɩn kʋtʋma lɛ.”<verse eid="EZR 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 9:3" />Gɛtɛ na nʋn ade nyayɩ fɔ, nan fɛɛran mɩɩn gɛgba ma mɩɩn gɛgba serelɛ, gɛ na wɔrɔ miin duyu ma miin bukpiri gɛ nan yɛ n si koro gɩɩ gɛyɔ ma amɩnlɛ yɩɩ gɛsa yaanɩ. <verse eid="EZR 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 9:4" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ gɩsaa gi ton wɔ kadama Wurubwarɛ wade gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ, e be tuma maakʋn yema ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be ye gisela bɛ ba fɔ, bɔɔ nʋnkwarɩ gɛtɛ ben di wuu koro. Gɛ na sara dʋkɔ kʋtʋma gɛtɛ ɔgyɔlɔ wuu gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gɩ nɩma.<verse eid="EZR 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 9:5" />Gɛtɛ ɔgyɔlɔ wuu gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gɩɩya wʋ nɩma fɔ, na tɔ na ye ɔkʋn gɛtɛ na sara dɩkpʋkpʋ daanɩ fɔ. Fɔ n sa mɩɩn gɛgba ma mɩɩn gɛgba serelɛ gɛtɛ nan fɛɛran bʋ fɔ gɛ na waran na kura na yaraba maalɔ na wùlà Yahwe, miin Wurubwarɛ, <verse eid="EZR 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 9:6" />gɛ na tiri onyun alan,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 9:6">“Oo, miin Wurubwarɛ, mɩɩn bʋnʋn bu ku gʋsɔ gɛ wʋ ba mɩ ɩnɩnfa gɛtɛ nan bʋma mɩɩn bʋnʋn n nya wɔ̀, yema taade-kpen ɩ lɩ da taayu gɛ tɩɩ dɩpwɛ dii gedi dɩ bʋn dɩ san gatala. <verse eid="EZR 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 9:7" />Ye tiitu ɛbɛ bɔɔya waanɩ bè ye ma ǹdò fɔ, tɩɩ dɩpwɛ dii gedi dɩ sɔ. Taade-kpen yii koro fɔ, gɩfɩɩ-fon gii begyu bee wolo, gɛ bee gye ɛtɩ ma tii begyu, ma tii gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bɩtà bɛ da bɔɔlɛ. Be kpila taanyan bɛ da, gɛ bɛ̀ sa tɩ ɩnɩnfa anlɛ gɛtɛ wù we ǹdò lɛ.<verse eid="EZR 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 9:8" />“Mɔ nkele, ɔya-pɩɩ wʋkɩ waanɩ fɔ, Yahwe tii Wurubwarɛ a wula ti gutunkoro gɛ a yɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be kuruma fɔ, be biri bɛ ba, gɛ bɛ bɛ sara aa gɛsarakʋn fɩrɩnfɩrɩn fɔ gaanɩ, gɛ awɔ tii Wurubwarɛ a tɛ tɩ gɛŋmaŋɩ gɛ a yɛ tɩ ti wura getuna bɛrɛɛ ti ye tɩɩ gɩdɩ gaanɩ. <verse eid="EZR 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 9:9" />Ma gɛtɛ tì di gɛ bɛdɩ gba fɔ, tii Wurubwarɛ en kere ti ya gɩdɩ gaanɩ. E tiri gɩnɩ-kpara e wùlà tɩ Perisiya begyu bʋnʋn. Ɛ tɛ tɩ nkpa-fon gɛtɛ tàà biri ti sere Wurubwarɛ Dikwo gɛtɛ nafɔ dɩ gbena fɔ, gɛ ɛ dɩyɛ tɩ Yuda ma Yerusalem baanɩ.<verse eid="EZR 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 9:10" />“Nkele tii Wurubwarɛ, ade-mɔmɔ gɛ taà nɩ dɔ̀ nyawʋ wʋʋ gama? Yema tɩn san aa-ise <verse eid="EZR 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 9:11" />gɛtɛ a dama aa aasaranyan gɛtɛ è di ɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ wo koro a tɛ fɔ yii koro. A dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ ii len yàà gyu gaanɩ yàà to lɛ, gì di gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bè si gii koro fɔ bɛ sa gɩ dɩdɩɩ. Bɛ ka baade-mɛlɛ karan-karan fɔ bɛ sa gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ powu dɩdɩɩ. <verse eid="EZR 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 9:12" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro ɩ kara ka yii bebi-nanɩ ɩ tɛ boo bebi-teni gɩna, gɛ ɩ kara to boo bebi-nanɩ ɩ tɛ boo bebi. Ɩ kara mɛ onyun-kɩlɩn ma ɛbɛ ade-ɩkɩ yaanɩ, gɛ ɩ kara di bɛ awɔlɔn. Gɛlɛ fɔ yaà wura ɔkɛma gɛ yaà di anyan-kpara gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ gɛ yaà di yɩ i kuruma yii bebi anlɛ adikurumanyan gɛtɛ yaà sara gakpaakpa.<verse eid="EZR 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 9:13" />“Taade-kpen ma dɩpwɛ gɛtɛ ti di fɔ na yɛ gɛ ade nyayɩ powu ɩ tama tɩ lɛ. Mɔ awɔ tii Wurubwarɛ an tiira tɩ giten wàà nɩma anlɛ gɛtɛ taade-kpen ì we, gɛ a biri a yɛ ɛtɩ nyabɛ ti kuruma lɛ.” <verse eid="EZR 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 9:14" />Nkele taà biri ti kere aa-ise fɔ tɩ ya taà biri tɩ ma to bɛnɩ nyabɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ ade-kyʋnlɛ lɛ boo bebi gɩna? Gengyi tɩ̀ mɛ gɛlɛ fɔ, an nan ka owurufa tii koro a kààrà, fɔ àà muru ɛtɩ powu gɛtɛ ɛnɩ-kɩlɩn gba e nan kuruma? <verse eid="EZR 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 9:15" />Oo Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ, aade ɩ̀ tʋna gɛ a yɛ ɛtɩ ti kuruma. Ma gɛtɛ ti di dɩpwɛ gɛ taanɩ ɛkɩ ɛn kʋtʋma gɛtɛ èè yela aa bʋnʋn gba fɔ, tì yela aa bʋnʋn.<verse eid="EZR 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZR 10" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛnɩ fɔ be tiri baade-kpen bɛ dɔ̀</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 10:1" />Gɛtɛ Esira ee tiri onyun gɛ ee tiri wade-kpen, gɛ ɛ̀ dɔ̀ ee wula gɛ ee fun koro ɛ fɩna dɩkpaara daanɩ fɔ, Isareli bɛnɩ dɩtɩnpan, beteni, ma bɛnanɩ, ma bebi be be tuma wakʋn. Gɛ ɛbɛ mɔ be wula gepepe. <verse eid="EZR 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 10:2" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yetiyeli wobi Sekaniya gɛtɛ e ye Elam wodu waanɩ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ Esira alan, “Tin di nʋnkwarɩ tii Wurubwarɛ bʋnʋn, yema ti to bendeni gɛtɛ bè sì ma ɛtɩ fɔ bɔɔ bɛnanɩ gɩna. Mɔ nyawʋ powu wʋʋ gama fɔ, Isareli è biri ɛ̀ ba bʋnʋn bʋʋ gɛgyagakʋn. <verse eid="EZR 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 10:3" />Nkele ɩ yɛ taà ta dikola ma tii Wurubwarɛ, fɔ taà berema bɛnanɩ nyabɛ ma boo bebi powu anlɛ gɛtɛ miinfonte ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bee di Wurubwarɛ ise fɔ yii koro fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ fɔ. Ɩ yɛ wàà mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Ose fɔ wuu wùlà fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 10:4" />Tɔ yela, yema ade nyayɩ ɩ̀ sa gɛ aa gʋlɔ gaanɩ, taà yela aa gama. Okoro sa koro ɔkɛma fɔ àà wʋ.”<verse eid="EZR 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 10:5" />Okoro Esira ɛ tɔ gɛ ɛ yɛ gedi gii bɛtɛlɛ gɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ, ma Lefi bete, ma Isareli powu bɛ kan ntam alɛ baà mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Sekaniya ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ. Gɛ ɛbɛ powu bɛ kan ntam. <verse eid="EZR 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 10:6" />Gɛ Esira e kpe e ye Wurubwarɛ dɩkpaara fɔ daanɩ gɛ ɛ da Eliyasibi wobi Yohohanan wakʋn. Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa dʋkɔ fɔ en di gɛ ɛn nyʋn yema ɛ̀ bɔ ɛ̀ sa gɛ dɩkpʋkpʋ daanɩ, nʋnkwarɩ gɛtɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be ye gisela gaanɩ fɔ ben di fɔ wu koro.<verse eid="EZR 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 10:7" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ sa ɔtʋn Yerusalem ma Yuda powu anɩ alɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be ye gisela gaanɩ bɛ ba fɔ, be be tuma Yerusalem. <verse eid="EZR 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 10:8" />Gɛ begyegeyelɛ ma bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ bɛ sɩ alɛ ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛn nan ba awi asiyee yaanɩ fɔ baà to wanyan powu gɛ baà berema wɔ be ye bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be ye gisela gaanɩ bɛ ba fɔ baanɩ.<verse eid="EZR 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 10:9" />Awi asiyee ɩtɔkɔ yaanɩ fɔ, Yuda bɛnɩ ma Benyamin bɛnɩ fɔ powu be be tuma Yerusalem. Gɛ ebon-yɛkɩfɛ duwi-dikpilinfɛ daanɩ fɔ, bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ bɛ sara Wurubwarɛ-dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ dɩɩ bʋnʋn. Fɔ koro gɩɩ gbɛrɛ bɛ yema ɛsʋn ɛɛ nʋ̀n ma ade gɛtɛ bee len bàà dɔ̀ fɔ yii koro. <verse eid="EZR 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 10:10" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Esira gɛtɛ è di gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ fɔ ɛ tɔ e yela gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, “In di nʋnkwarɩ, i to bendeni gɩna gɛ wʋ yɛ Isareli dɩpwɛ dii gedi fɔ dɩ sɔ dɩ fɩya. <verse eid="EZR 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 10:11" />Nkele i tiri yaade-kpen ɩ dɔ̀ ɩ tɛ Yahwe, yiitu ɛbɛ boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ, fɔ yàà mɛ wo gelenbi. I tiri koro i ye bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bè sì ma ɛyɩ fɛ baanɩ, fɔ yàà terema yɩɩ bendeni-sɔ fɔ.” <verse eid="EZR 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 10:12" />Ɛwʋ gɛ dikpi fɔ powu dɩ ka gɩta-dɩrɛ dɩ dɔ̀ alan,“aade ɩ̀ dɔ, wù di gɛtɛ tàà mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ fɔ. <verse eid="EZR 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 10:13" />Mɔ bɛnɩ kpekpesi n yela nfan lɛ, gɛ tɩ̀ sa gɛ ɛsʋn gɛnʋ̀n gɩɩya waanɩ okoro tɩn nan talɩ ti yela okòro gɛlɛ. Yema tɩ nan talɩ tɩ ka duwi-kɩlɩn abɛɛ awi anyɔɔ tɩ mɛ yɩɩ gʋtʋn, yema tɩ mɛ ade-kpen-dɩrɛ ade nyayɩ yaanɩ.” <verse eid="EZR 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 10:14" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro ɩ yɛ tɩɩ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ, bàà sara Yerusalem fɔ bàà nya ade fɔ yii koro. Ɩ yɛ bɛnɩ powu gɛtɛ be to bendeni-sɔ gɩna fɔ bàà ba ma bɔɔ ditele dɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ ma dɩɩ gɔdɔ gɩɩ bɛdɔ̀lɛ ka ma sere gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ èè kere wowurufa-dɩrɛ fɔ ya.” <verse eid="EZR 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 10:15" />Asaheli wobi Yonatan, ma Tikifa wobi Yasiya fɩya ma Mesulam, ma Lefi-te Sabetayi mɩnɩ to ade fɔ sa.<verse eid="EZR 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 10:16" />Okoro ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be gye gisela gaanɩ fɔ, bɛ mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ bɛ fɔ. Gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Esira e tiri bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bè di akpaara yɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ ɛkɩ-ɛkɩ e ye dɩkpaara-kamasɛ daanɩ gɛ bɛ ŋwara baayere. Ebon fwofɛ wo duwi gyangbasɛlɛ daanɩ fɔ, bɛ sara gɛ bɛ kya gegyu ade fɔ yaanɩ, <verse eid="EZR 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 10:17" />gɛ ebon-gyangbasɛlɛ wo duwi gyangbasɛlɛ daanɩ fɔ, be werema bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be to bendeni gɩna fɔ baade fɔ.<verse eid="EZR 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Beteni gɛtɛ be to bendeni gɩna</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 10:18" />Gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ boodu waanɩ fɔ, ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be to bendeni gɩna fɔ baayere n di:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:18">Yosadaki wobi Yosuwa ma wɔdɩrɛ ɛbɛ boodu waanɩ fɔ, ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be to bendeni gɩna fɔ n di</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:18">Maaseya, ma Eliyeseri, ma Yaribi ma Gedaliya. <verse eid="EZR 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 10:19" />(Ɛbɛ powu bɛ kan ntam alɛ baà kere bɔɔsɔ ɛbɛ bɛ ya, baà tiri ɛyɛran-teni be ye bɔɔ bɛnan baanɩ bàà ka tɛ dɩpwɛ dii gedi.)<verse eid="EZR 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 10:20" />Imeri wodu waanɩ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:20">Hanani, ma Sebadiya.<verse eid="EZR 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 10:21" />Harim wodu waanɩ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:21">Maaseya, ma Eliya, ma Semaya, ma Yehiyeli ma Usiya.<verse eid="EZR 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 10:22" />Pasuri wodu waanɩ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:22">Eliyonayi, ma Maaseya, ma Isimayeli, ma Netaneli, ma Yosabadi ma Elasa.<verse eid="EZR 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 10:23" />Lefi bete fɔ baanɩ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:23">Yosabadi, ma Simeyi, ma Kelaya gɛtɛ bè biri bee kpele alɛ Kelita fɔ, ma Petahiya, ma Yuda ma Eliyesa.<verse eid="EZR 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 10:24" />Ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ baanɩ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:24">Eliyasibi</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:24">Dikwo-dɩrɛ dɩɩ bɛdɩyɛlɛ baanɩ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:24">Salum, ma Telem, ma Wuri.<verse eid="EZR 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 10:25" />Isareli bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ baanɩ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:25">ye Parosi wodu waanɩ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:25">Ramiya, ma Isiya, ma Malikiya, ma Miyamin, ma Eleyasa, ma Malikiya, ma Benaya.<verse eid="EZR 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 10:26" />Elam wodu waanɩ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:26">Mataniya, ma Sekariya, ma Yehiyeli, ma Abidi, ma Yeremoti, ma Eliya.<verse eid="EZR 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 10:27" />Satu wodu waanɩ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:27">Eliyonayi, ma Eliyasibi, ma Mataniya, ma Yeremoti, ma Sabedi, ma Asisa.<verse eid="EZR 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 10:28" />Bebayi wodu waanɩ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:28">Yehohanan, ma Hananiya, ma Sabayi, ma Atilayi.<verse eid="EZR 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 10:29" />Bani wodu waanɩ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:29">Mesulam, ma maluki, ma Adaya, ma Yasubi, ma Seyali, ma Yeremoti.<verse eid="EZR 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 10:30" />Patati-Mowabi wodu waanɩ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:30">Adina, ma Kelali, ma Benaya, ma Maaseya, ma Mataniya, ma Besaleli, ma Binuwi, ma Manase.<verse eid="EZR 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 10:31" />Harim wodu waanɩ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:31">Eliyesa, ma Isiya, ma Malikiya, ma Kemaya, ma Kimon,<verse eid="EZR 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 10:32" />ma Benyamin, ma Maluki, ma Semariya.<verse eid="EZR 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 10:33" />Hasum wodu waanɩ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:33">Matenayi, ma Matata, ma Sabedi, ma Elifeleti, ma Yeremayi, ma Manase, ma Simeyi.<verse eid="EZR 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 10:34" />Bani wodu waanɩ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:34">Maadayi, ma Amiram, ma Wuweli,<verse eid="EZR 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 10:35" />ma Benaya, ma Bedeya, ma Keluhi, <verse eid="EZR 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 10:36" />ma Faniya, ma Meremoti, ma Eliyasibi, <verse eid="EZR 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 10:37" />ma Mataniya, ma Matenayi, ma Yasu.<verse eid="EZR 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 10:38" />Binuwi wodu waanɩ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:38">Simeyi, <verse eid="EZR 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 10:39" />ma Selemiya, ma Natan, ma Adaya, <verse eid="EZR 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 10:40" />ma Makinadebayi, ma Sasayi, ma Sarayi, <verse eid="EZR 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 10:41" />ma Asareli, ma Selemiya, ma Semariya, <verse eid="EZR 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 10:42" />ma Salum, ma Amariya, ma Yosefu.<verse eid="EZR 10:42" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 10:43" />Nebo wodu waanɩ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:43">Yeyeli, ma Matitiya, ma Sabedi, ma Sebina, ma Yadayi, ma Yoweli, ma Benaya.<verse eid="EZR 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 10:44" />Gɛlɛ wʋʋ bɛnɩ nyabɛ powu be to bendeni gɩna gɛ be wo bebi bɛ tɛ bɛ. Mɔ be kere bɛ bɛ ya ma boobi fɔ powu.<verse eid="EZR 10:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 10" />
</usx>